# No frontend/browser env is required for FlytBDR Copilot.
#
# Put server-only configuration in root .env.local or apps/server/.env.local:
# - DATABASE_URL
# - DATABASE_NAME
# - BETTER_AUTH_SECRET
# - GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY or GOOGLE_API_KEY
# - EMAIL_SERVER_* and EMAIL_ADMIN
#
# Never expose these values with a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix.
